						</li>
						<li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
							<xpath>Defs/HediffDef[defName="GR_WolfMuscularFibers"]/description</xpath>
							<value>
								<description>The subject's legs can be modified by weaving hybrid human/wolf muscle fibers within the base tissue, giving her a significant speed boost.</description>
